  // Moveset rules are the same as `humanoids.json` — see the header there; the short version is
  // that the role's brain decides which moves an actor MUST carry, and player weapon moves
  // (heavy_strike, shield_bash, sunder, skewer, whirlwind, execute) are off limits because
  // enemies cannot satisfy `equippedTag`.
  //
  // Nothing here carries its own loot table: family + role already pays.

